      },
      "message": "test(examples): add the catalog case 3d/rough-finish\n\nA small domed part: a 3D Pocket roughs it, then two 3D Finish\noperations (Parallel and Waterline) with a 6 mm ball finish it. The\ncase regenerates, verifies clean and posts its pinned program within\nthe 60 s debug budget. The 3D Pocket and 3D Finish guide sections now\nlink the case (generated blocks).\n\nFixes #2866\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
