      "message": "docs(examples): state what the 3d/rough-finish roughing leaves\n\nThe README said that the 3D Pocket leaves 0.5 mm on the dome and the\nplate. The program leaves 0 mm at the apex and on the plate, and 0.21\nto 0.38 mm on the flanks. The README now says that and links the three\nbugs that the case shows: #3669, #3670, #3671.\n\nRefs #2866\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
